{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "28740965-5982-85d0-b066-d996e716aed8",
  "created_at": "2026-01-22T11:02:59-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Fatima Correia",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Priya Raman",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:59:49-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, Newport Utilities, this is Priya. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T10:59:53-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello? Yes, good morning! I'm sorry, I'm a little hard of hearing, so I talk loud. You tell me if I'm too much."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T11:00:00-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're fine. What can I do for you today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T11:00:04-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's my water and sewer bill. It's way too high. I own a shop, and a pipe broke in the back room last month. Burst, water everywhere. The plumber fixed it, but now the bill is crazy and I'm not paying for water that went down the floor drain."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T11:00:19-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. Do you want to ask about a leak adjustment? Those are reviewed when a bill is high because of a repaired leak."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T11:00:27-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A what adjustment?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T11:00:29-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A leak adjustment. It's a request to review the charges for water lost through a break that has been repaired."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T11:00:36-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes! That. That's what I want. How do I get it? Is there a form? I don't want to hear that I have to come in, it's a whole morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T11:00:45-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's a request that goes with the account, and usually it asks for the repair date and a copy of the plumber's invoice. Can I have the service address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T11:00:54-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "126 Kingston Avenue. Up on the Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T11:00:57-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, I have the account up. I see the higher reading on the latest bill. Do you have the plumber's invoice?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T11:01:04-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I have it, sure. Can I send it to you? And can you email me another copy of the bill? I lost the paper one. The dog got to it, almost. I don't know. Just send it again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T11:01:16-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I can send a duplicate by email. What address should I use?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T11:01:21-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, you want me to say it now? Hold on, I'm in the car. [pause] Can you just use whatever you have on file?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T11:01:29-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can send it to the one on the account. I'll read back the beginning of it so you can confirm it's the right one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T11:01:37-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "What? Say it again, honey, I missed that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T11:01:40-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll read you the start of the email address on file so you can confirm it. Is that all right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T11:01:47-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, go ahead. [pause] Yep, that's the one. Good. Send it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T11:01:51-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Done. It should arrive within a few minutes. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T11:01:55-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, one more. Can I pay on a Saturday? I'm at the shop all week, and Saturday is the only day I'm not running around. Is anyone there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T11:02:04-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Hall isn't open on Saturdays, but you can pay online through the city's website any time, and there's a payment drop box at City Hall that's available outside of hours."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T11:02:14-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A drop box. Okay. Check or what?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T11:02:17-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A check with your account number on it is best. Please don't leave cash."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T11:02:22-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no cash. Fine. And the part about the leak, I should wait on that before I pay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T11:02:28-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Send the invoice and the request in first. I'll note on the account that an adjustment is being requested."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T11:02:34-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Sorry, I'm loud, my kid is going to be in the car in a minute and the backpack on that child, it's so heavy it tips them sideways when they walk to the car. Anyway. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T11:02:46-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No trouble. Do you want me to confirm the callback number I have on the account?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T11:02:51-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0188."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T11:02:53-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That matches. You'll get the email shortly. Have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T11:02:57-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, bye now!"
    }
  ],
